OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry in the
OL,6,Feast to start with some evening
OL,7,Fsunshine. Cloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fspread east through the evening and
OL,9,Fovernight, rain occasionally heavy in
OL,10,Fthe west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA cloudy morning with
OL,13,Foccasionally heavy rain. Drier in the
OL,14,Fafternoon with some brightness in the
OL,15,Feast, but further rain likely across
OL,16,FLochaber and the Great Glen.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMainly
OL,19,Fdry on Wednesday with just a few
OL,20,Fshowers. Bright spells and scattered
OL,21,Fshowers on Thursday and Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
